  "definition": "Licensed Forester Seal/Stamp",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-03-17",
  "historyNote": "#5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97 New. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98 New. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #13855, eff 3-17-24",
